{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 11, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "古", "id": "古"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "士", "id": "士"}, {"form": "失", "id": "失"}, {"form": "存", "id": "存"}, {"form": "居", "id": "居"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "挾", "id": "挾"}, {"form": "敬", "id": "敬"}, {"form": "時", "id": "時"}, {"form": "樂", "id": "樂"}, {"form": "母", "id": "母"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "知", "id": "知"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "variants": [], "id": "義"}, {"form": "興", "id": "興"}, {"form": "長", "id": "長"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}, {"form": "雞", "id": "雞"}, {"form": "食", "id": "食"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.386466576974748, "source": "事", "target": "士"}, {"weight": 2.856470206220483, "source": "時", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 3.7727609380946383, "source": "時", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 4.465908118654584, "source": "時", "target": "雞"}, {"weight": 3.079613757534693, "source": "時", "target": "食"}, {"weight": 3.5496173867804286, "source": "雞", "target": "失"}, {"weight": 4.465908118654584, "source": "雞", "target": "母"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "食", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.6933193964148026, "source": "食", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.575536360758419, "source": "存", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 2.6741486494265287, "source": "存", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 0.8023464725249373, "source": "存", "target": "知"}, {"weight": 1.2878542883066382, "source": "存", "target": "樂"}, {"weight": 1.421385680931161, "source": "存", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 2.38646